glib-networking provides static GIO modules. Link the pkg-config modules for
the enabled features: gioopenssl, giognutls, gioenvironmentproxy, giolibproxy.

Before the first use of GIO networking, register each linked module once:

    #include <gio/gio.h>
    extern "C" void g_io_openssl_load(GIOModule*);
    // In application initialization:
    g_io_openssl_load(nullptr);

Use g_io_gnutls_load, g_io_environmentproxy_load, or g_io_libproxy_load for
the corresponding modules. GIO_MODULE_DIR is not used for static modules.
